# Concurrent legs (D6): two autonomous committers append to INDEX.md — union
# merge is correct there because every line is independent, order-insensitive,
# and appended exactly once by its owning leg. The summary CSVs are NOT union-
# merged: aggregators REWRITE them whole (rows legitimately appear, change and
# vanish across re-aggregations), so they are per-leg FILES instead
# (…-summary-<leg>.csv) — two rewriting writers never share a target.
runs/INDEX.md merge=union
